{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Texas Twist Poker 3: Bandit\u2019s Run</strong> is a poker-infused tile-puzzler with the strategic depth of a roguelike deck-builder. Saddle up and chase down notorious Bandits by combining unique Jokers and powerful upgrades to create the 10 best poker hands in a 52-card deck. Shop wisely between rounds to build a formidable deck and craft a winning strategy to hunt down the Bandit and break their curse. Get ready for a high-stakes adventure that captures the wild spirit of Texas!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lasso 5 Cards to Make a Hand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Round up 5 cards in a cross shape, like cuttin\u2019 a handful from the herd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600310/extras/10139799a48b024caee5cb4378846d07.poster.avif?t=1768587468\" width=960 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600310/extras/10139799a48b024caee5cb4378846d07.webm?t=1768587468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600310/extras/10139799a48b024caee5cb4378846d07.mp4?t=1768587468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Twist Cards in Rows and Columns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twist a row or column to steer the herd for the best hands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600310/extras/7f02789e26c90141ecf5d272003e41bf.poster.avif?t=1768587468\" width=960 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600310/extras/7f02789e26c90141ecf5d272003e41bf.webm?t=1768587468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600310/extras/7f02789e26c90141ecf5d272003e41bf.mp4?t=1768587468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You See the Possibilities?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong> This game ain\u2019t easy. You\u2019ll need sharp eyes, quick reads, and a knack for wranglin\u2019 order out of chaos. Most folks find the board downright overwhelming. If you\u2019re on the fence, try the free demo first. If the tutorial barnyard feels like child\u2019s play, then you\u2019ve got what it takes to saddle up for the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600310/extras/03655a86b245fbf0c537bdc174536efd.poster.avif?t=1768587468\" width=960 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600310/extras/03655a86b245fbf0c537bdc174536efd.webm?t=1768587468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600310/extras/03655a86b245fbf0c537bdc174536efd.mp4?t=1768587468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2660\u00a0<strong>Endless Possibilities:</strong> Every deal, twist, and Joker reshapes your run. Replay seeded runs to perfect your strategy and challenge your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2666\u00a0<strong>Deep Campaign:</strong> Face off against 50+ Bandits with unique curses, mechanics, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\u00a0<strong>Loads of Choices:</strong>\u00a0Use Jokers, Mods, Upgrades,  and Trinkets to create dynamic and heart-pounding synergies to beat the Bandits.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Jokers, each with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A baker\u2019s dozen of boosts for each Joker adding further abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ card variants to enhance your deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Upgrade cards to level up specific poker hands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 Trinkets to provide permanent buffs for your current run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2663\u00a0<strong>Immersive Experience:</strong> Dive into Texas culture and history as you hunt Bandits across the state. Enjoy the flavors, wildlife, and geography as you twist your way across Texas!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600310?t=1768587468","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600310/41ccfab188c0cf95a6ef8f80090088d58a924786/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768587468","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600310/e6f5eebb617b807d7bd2ac0c8fa9d19345c94132/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768587468","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600310/e6f5eebb617b807d7bd2ac0c8fa9d19345c94132/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768587468","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3958400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Texas Twist Poker 3: Bandit\u2019s Run</strong> is a poker-infused tile-puzzler with the strategic depth of a roguelike deck-builder. Saddle up and chase down notorious Bandits by combining unique Jokers and powerful upgrades to create the 10 best poker hands in a 52-card deck. Shop wisely between rounds to build a formidable deck and craft a winning strategy to hunt down the Bandit and break their curse. Get ready for a high-stakes adventure that captures the wild spirit of Texas!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><str